{"resourceIdentifier":"3112","resourceName":"BABIL BIOGAS POWER PLANT","description":"The Project is a biogas-to-energy project that generates renewable energy by capturing biogas from animal manure -via anaerobic digestion- and utilizing it to produce thermal and electric energy through biogas systems. The project is being implemented by Babil Biyogaz Enerji Sistemleri Sanayi ve Ticaret Anonim Şirketi, as the project owner, Eyyübiye district, Şanlıurfa province, in Turkey.\r\n\r\nCattle and chicken manure which are generated at farms and left to decay in anaerobic conditions, are collected daily through special sewage trucks equipped with close tanks to prevent any odour and/or manure leakages and to be fed into the anaerobic digesters at the proposed biogas power plant. \r\n\r\nThe project has received Electricity Generation License (EGL) issued by the Energy Market Regulatory Authority (EMRA) in Turkey on October 22nd, 2020, for the maximum operational licensed capacity of 4.68 MWe/h.\r\n\r\nThe project has become operational by starting to generate electricity and feeding it directly to the Turkish national grid on October 31st, 2020. \r\n\r\nThe manure which is supplied to the proposed project plant is coming from around 50,000 cattle and 1,800,000 chicken living at the farms daily which are fed into the anaerobic digesters at the project site.\r\n\r\nThe project has obtained the approval of Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) issued by the Ministry of Environment, Urbanization, and Climate Change in Turkey on September 17th, 2020. \r\n\r\nThis project adopts the renewable crediting period of 7 years, twice renewable for a total of 21 years. The estimated average net annual emission reductions are 417,287 tCO2eq/y.","location":{"latitude":37.086482,"longitude":38.683716},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-25","endExclusive":"2022-06-25","endInclusive":"2022-06-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3112"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ŞANLIURFA"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"73244"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV SÜD South Asia Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"04/07/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 31/10/2020 - 30/10/2027"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=65386&IDKEY=ilksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098c90167294","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Draft Joint-Project-Description-Monitoring-Report-Babil Biogas Power Plant-(ID3112)-v4.1-220422.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-04-22T14:34:10.307Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=65385&IDKEY=8kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909090165915","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation- Babil Biogas Power Plant (ID312)-v4.1-140422.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-04-22T14:33:34.1Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=115347&IDKEY=8097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn870159063513","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS Joint PD&MR_Babil